      "section": "CALL TO ORDER",
      "body": "PlanningCommission",
      "motion": "A motion was made by Planning Commission Member Rogers to forward a positive recommendation to City Council to approve the Item 2 to add the monument signs A1-5 to 15 feet. As the applicant noted, on monument sign B, they would offer that being a 26 foot sign. I would request that be 25, with a conditional use for that to occur once George Washington Boulevard is connected. Discussion between Commission Members regarding the motion. A suggested amendment was proposed by Commission Member Fisher to consider removing the condition, as far the completion of the road and allowing it to happen now, at the 25 feet, as with the completion of the road it could be taller. Commissioner Rogers agreed to the amendment.",
